    "html": "<p>The half-life of radioactive nuclide A is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\"></span>. The initial activity of a pure sample of nuclide A is the same as the initial activity of a pure sample of another radioactive nuclide, B. After <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2T\"></span> the ratio <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{Activity\\: of\\: sample\\: containing\\: nuclide\\: A}{Activity\\: of\\: sample\\: containing\\: nuclide\\: B}=8\"></span>. What is the half-life of nuclide B?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.2T\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.4T\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2.5T\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"5T\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
